{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/39"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The voluptuous one (Babel) sprawled at ease, she did not fear widowhood, for far from her was the end of the kingdom. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/40"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Struggle, deliverers, take the royal gown from Edom and adorn the Lord with the splendour of the Kingdom. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"text":"As it was written through Thy prophet: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"1","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/quotes/obadiah_1_21/obadiah_1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"21","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/quotes/obadiah_1_21/obadiah_1/21"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:obadiah/1/21"}}
{"text":"Deliverers shall ascend Mount Zion to judge the mountain of Esau and dominion shall be the Lord’s."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":" "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/41"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"God hates falsehood, yet it is upon our tongue; He demands truth, but it is not there; and, therefore, distant became the Kingdom. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/42"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Almighty, remove guilt from Thy hosts that they may cry out to Thee with the Teruah of the Kingdom. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"text":"As it is written in Thy Torah: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"23","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/quotes/numbers_23_21/numbers_23"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"21","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/quotes/numbers_23_21/numbers_23/21"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/23/21"}}
{"text":"And He observed no wrong in Jacob nor did He see trouble in Israel. The Lord, his God, is with him, and the royal Teruah is within him."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":" "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/43"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Gird Thyself in loftiness, surround Thyself with strength, so that no stranger may rule over the Kingdom. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n272.jpg","n":"126"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/44"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The world will be firm when the wicked is shaken off, the Lord will set justice beneath Him and put on the crown of the Kingdom. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"text":"As it is written in Thy holy words: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"93","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/quotes/psalms_93_1/psalms_93"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"1","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/quotes/psalms_93_1/psalms_93/1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/93/1"}}
{"text":"The Lord has reigned, clothed in majesty, the Lord has clothed Himself in strength. He has girded Himself, the world is firmly founded, it does not totter."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":" "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/45"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Thou wilt take vengeance on nations, Thou wilt rebuke peoples, Thou wilt break the staff of evil, ruling over the Kingdom. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/46"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Thou wilt make idols disappear, Thou alone wilt be exalted, Thou wilt be invoked for ever, unique in the Kingdom. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"text":"As it is written through Thy prophet: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"14","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/quotes/zechariah_14_9/zechariah_14"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"9","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/quotes/zechariah_14_9/zechariah_14/9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:zechariah/14/9"}}
{"text":"The Lord will be King over the whole earth, on that day will the Lord be One and His name One."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":" And it is written in Thy Torah: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"6","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/quotes/deuteronomy_6_4/deuteronomy_6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"4","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ahallelah_elohai/quotes/deuteronomy_6_4/deuteronomy_6/4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:deuteronomy/6/4"}}
{"text":"Hear, O Israel, the Lord is our God, the Lord is One."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":" "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
